# Build context hygiene for the root Dockerfile (three targets: api, worker, web).
# The local root .env is read by apps/web/next.config.ts at `next build` and must never enter an
# image; nested .env files sit on the api/worker dotenv paths. deploy/ and docker/postgres/init/
# are deliberately NOT ignored: the api image carries the deploy bundle (ADR-0040).
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
terraform
docs
.github
*.md
